  "Empowers you and your party members on screen for the duration shown: +50 max HP, +25 max MP, +2 stun resistance, and +2 MR for each party member it reaches. You also gain Elemental Fire, and everyone gets a 16-second Counter Mirror whose chance comes from your stats.": "在顯示的持續時間內強化你與畫面內的隊伍成員：最大 HP +50、最大 MP +25、昏迷抗性 +2，每多一名受影響的隊員魔防再 +2。你也會獲得屬性之火，所有人都獲得 16 秒的鏡反射，其機率取決於你的能力值。"
